5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I believe it would be wise to start calmly and observe one another before we make any hasty decisions. Let us be patient.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with you, Jonathan. It is always best to start with a kind heart and a patient mind. Let us get to know one another gently before we decide anything.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Patience is fine, but we shouldn't be naive. While observation is necessary, we must also establish a logical framework for how we will evaluate behavior and contradictions moving forward. Blind kindness won't find the werewolf.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm excited to play with you all! I agree with Asuka—we should be smart about this. Let's be friendly, but let's also keep a close eye on everything everyone says!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"A logical framework is a start, Asuka, but don't let your desire for structure blind you to the nuances of behavior. I'll be watching. Let's see who among us is actually being honest.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we all agree on the importance of observation, though our methods differ. I find Asuka's call for logic and Shion's focus on nuance both intriguing. Let us simply listen and see what unfolds.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is lovely to see such a spirited discussion. As long as we remain respectful and supportive of one another, I am sure we will find the right path together. I am happy to follow your lead.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, following blindly is dangerous. We need to be critical of every claim. If we simply ""follow a lead"" without verification, we are essentially handing the game to the werewolf and the possessed.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,@Asuka is right! We can't just be nice; we have to be detectives! I'll be looking for any weird clues or mistakes. Let's make this a challenge and find the werewolf fast!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your enthusiasm is almost endearing, but ""detective work"" without a cold eye is just guessing. Let's not mistake excitement for insight. I prefer to let the contradictions reveal themselves naturally.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is interesting how our perspectives diverge. While some seek a structured hunt, others prefer a natural unfolding. I believe the truth often reveals itself in the quiet spaces between our words. Let us continue to observe.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very poetic way of putting it, Jonathan. I believe that if we keep our hearts open and treat each other with kindness, the truth will naturally come to light. I trust you all.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, trust is a luxury we cannot afford in this game. @Jonathan, your poetic approach is vague. We need to decide now: will we prioritize the Seer's potential information or rely on behavioral analysis?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I think we should definitely prioritize the Seer! If someone knows for sure who the werewolf is, that's the fastest way to win! I'm ready to listen and act quickly once we have a lead!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, prioritizing the Seer is obvious, but relying on them too early makes them a target. A calculated silence is often more valuable than a rushed revelation. Let's see who tries too hard to lead us.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"A calculated silence, as Shion suggests, may indeed be the safest path for now. Let us enter the first night with a quiet mind and see what the morning brings. I look forward to our next conversation.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree. Let us all have a peaceful night's rest. I will be praying for everyone's safety and looking forward to seeing your smiling faces tomorrow morning. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will be watching for any inconsistencies tomorrow. While some prefer poetry and prayers, I will be focusing on the facts. Good night.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Good night, everyone! I'm going to do my best to find some clues tonight. I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow! Let's catch that werewolf!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,"Facts are only as useful as the person interpreting them, Asuka. I'll be interested to see if your ""logic"" leads you to the right conclusion or just a convenient one. Good night.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
