66,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a somber morning. Kenji is gone, and Asuka has been attacked. This suggests that Kenji was likely not the werewolf, as the werewolf would not attack their own partner or themselves. We must be very careful now.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, this is such a tragedy. My heart goes out to poor Kenji and Asuka. To lose two of our friends so quickly is simply devastating. I hope we can find the truth soon so no one else has to suffer.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, your logic is flawed. The werewolf attacking Asuka doesn't clear Kenji; it only proves Asuka wasn't the werewolf. Kenji's reckless claim was a failed gamble. Now, we must identify the remaining threat.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, I apologize if my reasoning seemed simplistic. I merely meant that the loss of two players in one night narrows our circle significantly. With Asuka gone, we have lost a strong logical voice. Who do you suspect now?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is so frightening to think that the werewolf is still among us. @Shion, you seem so certain of everything, but I worry that we are all just feeling confused. Does anyone have any ideas on how we can find the truth peacefully?","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, peace is a luxury we can no longer afford. @Jonathan, since you're asking, look at the remaining players. The werewolf is hiding in plain sight, likely pretending to be as ""confused"" as you both are.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, your words are becoming quite sharp. While I agree that we must be vigilant, accusing those who are simply cautious can be a way to deflect suspicion. I am still observing.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, please do not be so harsh with Jonathan. We are all frightened and doing our best. I only wish for us to support one another so we can find the werewolf together.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, your desire for support is precisely what a Possessed would use to blend in. @Jonathan, ""observing"" while the village shrinks is just another word for hesitation. Who is actually contributing a solution here?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, your aggression is starting to feel like a mask for something else. By attacking our caution, you are attempting to isolate us. I believe the most dangerous person is the one trying to force a conclusion through intimidation.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, please, let us not turn on each other. It makes me so sad to see such anger. I only want us to be kind and patient so we can find the truth together. I will trust you, Jonathan.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, your blind trust in Jonathan is a liability. @Jonathan, calling my logic ""intimidation"" is a convenient way to avoid answering for your own inaction. You're both playing the victims while the wolf wins. Who is actually the threat here?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
